direction: down
"derived-credit": "derived-credit\nConsumer CAS reservation precedes pending exchange;\nreservation survives seal and covers empty-result\ncompletion"
"producer-release": "producer-release\nPending and wake publication plus last target access\nprecede release decrement; all gate modifications\nremain RMW within incarnation"
"producer-zero": "producer-zero\nObserve closed zero through acquire and valid RMW\nfrontier; open zero and last contributor alone are\ninsufficient"
"storage-commit": "storage-commit\nBoth gates closed and drained; exclusive pending\ninspection after all claims/root handoffs; native\nempty receipt is not whole VM retirement"
"consumer-reserve": "consumer-reserve\nOne coherent open/count snapshot and CAS; close\ninvalidates stale snapshot; reservation count not\ninferred from pending bit"
"root-spill": "root-spill\nR1 may be a C local and SELF may become live\ncarrier; spill selected carrier before GC and\npublish correct root location"
"root-reload": "root-reload\nCollector rewrites scanned slot; reload live carrier\nbefore use; local R1 is not automatically a\ncollector root"
"consumer-zero": "consumer-zero\nSeal consumer gate only after producer closed-zero\nreceipt; observe drained reservations and preserve\ndeferred/unknown/root custody"
"producer-release" -> "producer-zero"
"producer-zero" -> "consumer-zero"
"consumer-reserve" -> "derived-credit"
"derived-credit" -> "root-spill"
"root-spill" -> "root-reload"
"root-reload" -> "consumer-zero"
"producer-zero" -> "storage-commit"
"consumer-zero" -> "storage-commit"
"derived-credit" -> "storage-commit"
"consumer-reserve" -> "root-spill"
proof: "SysML -> ASCENT -> QNT / Lean; source + platform OPEN"
"storage-commit" -> proof
gain0: "gate-cost\nProtocol counts only; SC is initial profile and weaker\norder is not admitted; existing flags already coalesce"
proof -> gain0
gain1: "final-check\nNo single zero or last decrement licenses VM cleanup;\nroot/native/roster receipts remain necessary"
proof -> gain1
gain2: "root-cost\nDirect PSTATE registers need no extra local spill; k\ncomes from effective masks/configuration, not an\nassumed constant"
proof -> gain2
gain3: "net-condition\nNo runtime speed or build-time benefit established;\nmodern C is sufficient to express the contract; Zig\nremoves none of these obligations"
proof -> gain3
